{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1147223-becoming-a-supernal-entity","id":1147223,"title":"Becoming a Supernal Entity","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-05T15:23:46-07:00","id":1147223,"title":"Becoming a Supernal Entity","content":"If my mage wants to become a supernal entity there are a variety of paths to do so as I understand (depending on interpretation). If my Mastigos or my Thyrsus reaches that point are they still a human by all means? For someone who is in the 'Scion of God' Legacy they become a spirit upon death. Can a Mastigos do something similar and become a demon in pandemonium? Or is that just a legacy specific idea? Does becoming an astral being equate to becoming supernal like a Morphean? Is becoming a supernal entity the end result of the golden road or is an archmage still human? <br /> <br /> I know these are weird big endgame ideas and answers will probably be odd, but any answers would be appriciated. <br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16848-brassfist","name":"Brassfist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T15:30:32-07:00","id":1147224,"title":"","content":"Becoming a Supernal Entity is what happens when you Ascend, basically, depending on your point of view.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T16:37:30-07:00","id":1147237,"title":"","content":"Prefacing that this is how I remember it off the top of my head:<br /> <br /> The Golden Road is one particular means (the most reliable known means) of becoming a supernal god, and for archmasters it is a work in progress: the Golden Road is not complete until they Ascend. An archmaster is human until they complete their great work of imperium, at which point they become <i>a living symbol or idea,</i> like other supernal gods. (Contrast with astral goetia, who are <i>living thought-forms.</i> Can an concept exist without anyone to conceptualize it?)<br /> <br /> There's more to Ascension than there is to transforming your human form into that of a spirit or ghost lich.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 10-05-2017, 07:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T16:55:07-07:00","id":1147242,"title":"","content":"There's also the &quot;Feast of Stones&quot; from Keys to the Supernal Tarot (assuming your ST decides the version of it that worked is the canon one), but that one especially requires being something of a complete monster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come visit our unofficial Mage: the Awakening Discord Server!<br /> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Z42DJ9h\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/Z42DJ9h</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13241-biston","name":"Biston","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13241_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T18:03:28-07:00","id":1147625,"title":"","content":"Ascension does also not require you to be an Archmaster. Regular Mages Ascend far more often than Archmasters do (if only by dint of there being far, far more regular Mages than there are Archmasters; it is still a vanishingly rare thing).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T17:50:19-07:00","id":1147892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1147223-becoming-a-supernal-entity?p=1147625#post1147625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ascension does also not require you to be an Archmaster. Regular Mages Ascend far more often than Archmasters do (if only by dint of there being far, far more regular Mages than there are Archmasters; it is still a vanishingly rare thing).</div> </div> </div> </div>Source? Imperial Mysteries states that the Golden Road Path is the only non-legendary path to Ascension and that those allowing non-archmasters to ascend are especially dubious, so if anything regular mages ascensions are extremely rare if they are even real.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/343-suleri-drals","name":"Suleri Drals","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T18:11:39-07:00","id":1147903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Suleri Drals</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1147223-becoming-a-supernal-entity?p=1147892#post1147892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Source? Imperial Mysteries states that the Golden Road Path is the only non-legendary path to Ascension and that those allowing non-archmasters to ascend are especially dubious</div> </div> </div> </div>It says that archmages are predisposed to skepticism regarding Traveler Ascension, and that predisposition is easy to explain considering what you have to do to become an archmage. Second Edition's section on Ascension makes it pretty clear that anyone can Ascend \u2014 neither of its example characters are archmages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T12:46:33-07:00","id":1148093,"title":"","content":"What Satchel said.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}